# Personal, non-commercial preservation/study repo: the original КЛАД material
# (binaries, extracted data, disassembly) IS tracked on purpose. Only build and
# tooling artifacts are ignored. See design/legal.md for the why.

# --- Build artifacts ---
build/
*.o
*.wasm
*.html.mem
src/web/*.js
src/web/*.wasm
src/web/*.data
target/

# --- Tooling / misc ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
emsdk/
*.log

# --- Editor ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# CI-built site (GitHub Actions rebuilds & deploys it)
_site/

# The published WASM build IS tracked (served by GitHub Pages from /play).
!/play/
!/play/**
